<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Anglo Irish Bank year pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>Anglo Irish Bank year pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>					  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.46		   vs 5.70</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.2		    vs 1.36</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 3.7		    vs 3.36</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    24.1		   vs 9.25</p>
<p> Net interest income    42.5		   vs 36.7</p>
<p> Total income	     56.6		   vs 46.4</p>
<p> Bad debt provision     6.6		    vs 6.8</p>
<p> Tax charge		 5.4		    vs 5.1</p>
<p> Net taxed		  18.7		   vs 14.0</p>
<p> Registration date	December 10</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 22</p>
<p> Ex-dividend date	 December 2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Anglo Irish Bank Corp Plc.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom 353 1 660 3377</p>
